@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

state Off <<initial>>
state Active
state Ringing

Off : entry / system starts
Off : do / wait for alarm setting

Active : entry / alarm is set
Active : do / wait for alarm time

Ringing : entry / alarm time reached
Ringing : do / alarm is ringing

Off --> Active : setAlarm
Active --> Ringing : currentTime == alarmTime
Ringing --> Active : stopAlarm
Active --> Active : wait

@enduml
